<title>NETHERLANDS: ING gets Romanian life insurance licence.</title>
<headline>ING gets Romanian life insurance licence.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch financial services firm ING Groep NV said on Monday it had received a licence to offer life insurance products in Romania.</p>
<p>The insurer will start operating in Romania under the name Nationale-Nederlanden Romania.</p>
<p>ING said it was planning to start business in the middle of 1997 and that the head office would be in Bucharest.</p>
<p>ING said it was already present in Eastern Europe in Poland, Hungary, Slovakia and the Czech Republic.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
